#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:56
#. Diagram label
msgid "All green per rule 1?"
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:82
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Do not merge. The next wake reads the checks again."
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:33
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Every 10 minutes in the merge window, and hourly outside it, as a backstop. Otherwise a subscribed PR event, a main run finishing, or a sibling's message wakes it. Never a polling loop inside a turn."
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:57
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Every check run on the head SHA has finished, and anything pending blocks; wait for every tier, e2e included. The full tier ran (the No new failures judge, or every full test shard); a draft or fast-tier-only pass never counts. Each check is green as judged: where the No new failures judge exists its success is the verdict, otherwise each check concluded success, skipped or neutral. A cancelled job counts only when a later run of the same workflow on the same head passed that job. merge:watch prints this verdict per PR."
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:13
#. Diagram label
msgid "Merge manager watch: wake, read the queue live, route"
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:18
#. Diagram label
msgid "Merge steward"
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/merge-manager-watch.bpmn:63
#. Diagram label
msgid "Merge train"
msgstr ""

